{"id":"propiedad","lemma":"propiedad","pos":"noun","rank":1223,"glosses":["propriety (fact of possessing something), proprietary","property, belongings, estate (something that is possessed especially a real estate)","ownership (state of possessing something)"],"ipa":"/pɾopjeˈdad/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"propiedades"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-propiedad.wav","examples":[{"text":"Fuera de mi propiedad.","en":"Get off my property.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448340"},{"text":"Nunca he tenido propiedades en Australia.","en":"I've never owned property in Australia.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/508902"},{"text":"Me pertenece esta propiedad.","en":"I own this property.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449626"},{"text":"La propiedad es mía.","en":"The property is mine.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453110"},{"text":"Esta es una propiedad privada.","en":"This is private property.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75773"}]}